            "notes": "This is where the build will start to depend on what you are up against. I normally will go  [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) here to get a bit more damage out even with high heals but I have started to use  [Voidhoppers](item_d4ce0c76-2500-40d6-b066-dca303be097f) more lately. \n\nIf you are up against characters who can cause a negative affect and you don't have a kiri,  [Voidhoppers](item_d4ce0c76-2500-40d6-b066-dca303be097f) is fantastic because it acts like a cleanse. I pick it when going up against an ana, junker queen, and ashe always but depending on the build they run I will also pick it for junkrat, rein, or zen. \n\nThis round pick up  [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) because it will give you cool down reduction on both your fade and orbs based on how many people they heal.",
