            "notes": "If you picked  [Voidhoppers](item_d4ce0c76-2500-40d6-b066-dca303be097f) round three you may think you pick  [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) here but I tend to go  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) over  [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) here. My reasoning is you will get more orbs because of your primary fire compared to just splitting your main orb in three. \n\nThis round make sure your items have two uses not just ability power but a secondary benefit, whether it is slowing enemies, reducing healing, or extending the reach of your orbs.  [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) is great here because you now release orbs based on every 50 bionic energy you use so refilling it from your fade makes you have constant uptime on your orbs from your new power.",
